  {
    "id": 2003009110010,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "星って歌ってるんだって",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charCategory": "stand_costume",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040030040",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "その星は、天体の方？\r\nそれともめぐるたちのことか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あはは、ごめんごめんっ\r\n本番直前だし、どっちだーってなるよね！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "今の星は、夜空に輝く星の方っ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そっちか\r\nそれで、星が歌うってどういうことなんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ネットで見かけた話なんだけどね",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "星──厳密に言えば恒星なんだけど、音を発するらしいんだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それを、『星は歌う』って表現した人がいるの",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "へえ、詩的だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ね",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "宇宙は真空だから、当然わたしたちには聞こえないし",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もし真空じゃなくても、聞こえる音じゃないんだって",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "なんだったかな……ヘルツがどうとか……\r\n難しくて、歌うんだーってことしか覚えてないんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、大丈夫。わかった\r\n人間の可聴域を超えてるんだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうそう！　それ……っ！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "すごいね……！　\r\nプロデューサー、何も見てないのにわかっちゃった！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるが言いたいことは、なんとなくわかるよ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんたって、結構一緒に居るからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへっ……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──それで？　星は歌うぞってことだけじゃないんだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっそうそう！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110140"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "bg": "00237",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 3000
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──あのね？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "誰も聞いてくれないかもしれないのに\r\n誰にも届かないかもしれないのに",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "星は、ずっと歌い続けたんだなぁって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ！　星同士は聞こえてたかもだし、\r\n届いてたかもなんだけど！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110180"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00009",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "とっても長い時間を経て、それに気付いた『人』がいて\r\nそうして、わたしまで届いたんだなって──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "星は歌ってるんだよーって、届いた……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それがね、なんだかわたしたちみたいだなって思ったの",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110210"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "──本当の星になったみたい",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110220"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしたちはイルミネーションスターズだから、\r\nどうしても他人事には思えなくって！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だって、想いを込めて今まで歌ってきて",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110240"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうしたら……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうしたら──\r\nいつの間にか、アメリカまで届いてたの",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "笑顔にするのがわたしのお仕事なのに、\r\n笑顔にしてもらったのはわたしの方だった",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "歌い続ければ届くんだって、友達と星が教えてくれたの",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それが、どんなに遠くても、何光年先でも",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110300"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐる……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110310,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしね、届けたいなって思ったんだ\r\n海の向こうはもちろん、地球の裏側にだって！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110320,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だから、今日のお仕事も頑張ってくる！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009110330,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "見ててね、プロデューサー！\r\nわたし、どこまでも届くように歌い続けるから！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300911/2003009110330"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]